{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sharpen your mind and get ready to slide toward victory \u2014 this is just the beginning!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sliding Knight: Demo Edition</strong> is an early preview designed to let players experience the core mechanics of the game.<br>In this demo:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control a brave knight through <strong>26 challenging levels</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every move counts \u2014 plan ahead carefully with limited moves.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter clever maps, traps, and puzzles that test your logic and precision.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909940/extras/b524c75b308fd2c9181487b17a37c5be.avif?t=1761919199\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This version showcases the <strong>atmosphere, puzzle style, and strategic gameplay</strong> of the full release.<br>The complete game will include <strong>new mechanics</strong>, <strong>more levels</strong>, <strong>visual variety</strong>, and <strong>customization options</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is only the first step.<br>Don\u2019t forget to <strong>add the full game to your wishlist!</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3909940?t=1761919199","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3909940?t=1761919199","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909940/112636a07a657be90394f2f8201586583e3f469d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761919199","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909940/112636a07a657be90394f2f8201586583e3f469d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761919199","categor